# Development ledger

Status: CONTINUOUS_LEDGER
Milestone: Evidence-grounded repository engineering history
Dependencies: None

## Purpose
Keep dated technical decisions and verification receipts without inventing user
approval or publishing private continuity. This perpetual ledger is not an issue.

## Tasks
- Append meaningful engineering outcomes and actual failures.
- Attribute old evidence without representing it as newly run validation.
- Keep target qualification, human acceptance and publication distinct.

## Acceptance criteria
- Receipts describe observed outcomes and explicit remaining limitations.
- Raw requests, applicant values, private artifacts and credentials stay outside this ledger.

## Completion evidence
Ongoing record; individual bounded outcomes belong to numbered workstreams.

